-- md5_written: the two re-cut targets, abb0e221 (engine) and 82073ba9 (child). W1's Wall 11446 says its rebuild equals W4's re-cut targets; it does not print the two md5s. W1 CONFIRMS THEM WHEN IT GRADES THIS ROW.
